        -:   80:/**
        -:   81: * Variant information for a schematic symbol.
        -:   82: *
        -:   83: * Schematic symbol variants are a set of field and/or properties differentials against the default symbol
        -:   84: * values.  Each symbol instance may contain 0 or more variants.
        -:   85: *
        -:   86: * @note The #REFERENCE field is immutable across variants. Changing it would effectively be a new board.
