        -:  340:
        -:  341:    /**
        -:  342:     * Compare sheets by their page number. If the actual page number is equal, use virtual page
        -:  343:     * numbers to compare.
        -:  344:     *
        -:  345:     * @return -1 if aSheetPathToTest is greater than this (should appear later in the sort order)
