        -:  489:    bool TestForRecursion( const wxString& aSrcFileName, const wxString& aDestFileName );
        -:  490:
        -:  491:    /**
        -:  492:     * Make the sheet file name relative to its parent sheet.
        -:  493:     *
        -:  494:     * This should only be called when changing the parent sheet path such performing a save
        -:  495:     * as or a new schematic without a project in stand alone mode.  The sheet file name is
        -:  496:     * only made relative if the current file name is relative.  Absolute sheet file name paths
        -:  497:     * are a user choice so do not change them.
        -:  498:     *
        -:  499:     * Sheet file name paths are set according to the following criteria:
        -:  500:     *  - If the sheet file name path is in the same as the parent sheet file name path, set
        -:  501:     *    the sheet file name to just the file name and extension with no path.
        -:  502:     *  - If the sheet file name path can be made relative to the parent sheet file name path,
        -:  503:     *    set the sheet file name using the relative path.
        -:  504:     *  - If the sheet file name path cannot be converted to a relative path, then fall back to
        -:  505:     *    the absolute file name path.
        -:  506:     */
        -:  507:    void MakeFilePathRelativeToParentSheet();
        -:  508:
        -:  509:    /**
        -:  510:     * Attempt to add new symbol instances for all symbols in this sheet path prefixed
        -:  511:     * with \a aPrefixSheetPath.
        -:  512:     *
        -:  513:     * The new symbol instance data will be assigned by the following criteria:
        -:  514:     *  - If the instance data can be found for this sheet path, use the instance data.
        -:  515:     *  - If the instance data cannot be found for this sheet path and the instance data cache
        -:  516:     *    for the symbol is not empty, use the first instance data in the cache.
        -:  517:     *  - If the cache is empty and the library symbol link is valid, set the instance data
        -:  518:     *    from the library symbol.
        -:  519:     *  - If all else fails, set the reference to "U?", the unit to 1, and everything else to
        -:  520:     *    an empty string.
        -:  521:     *
        -:  522:     * @param aPrefixSheetPath is the sheet path to prefix to this sheet path for the new symbol
        -:  523:     *        instance.
        -:  524:     * @param aProjectName is the name of the project for the new symbol instance data.
        -:  525:     */
