        -:  581:/**
        -:  582: * A container for handling #SCH_SHEET_PATH objects in a flattened hierarchy.
        -:  583: *
        -:  584: * #SCH_SHEET objects are not unique, there can be many sheets with the same filename and
        -:  585: * that share the same #SCH_SCREEN reference.   Each The schematic file (#SCH_SCREEN) may
        -:  586: * be shared between these sheets and symbol references are specific to a sheet path.
        -:  587: * When a sheet is entered, symbol references and sheet page number are updated.
        -:  588: */
